      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Prince Henry and the Lord of Westmoreland.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 18,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 27,
          "end": 47,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142382/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1653507,
        "end": 1653643,
        "line": 62282,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@142382",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_9.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142522",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PRINCE.\nHow now, blown Jack? How now, quilt?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142522/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142522/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1653647,
        "end": 1653721,
        "line": 62286,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@142522",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_9.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PRINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142600",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FALSTAFF.\nWhat, Hal! How now, mad wag? What a devil dost thou in Warwickshire? My good Lord of Westmoreland, I cry you mercy. I thought your honour had already been at Shrewsbury.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142600/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142600/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 179,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1653725,
        "end": 1653936,
        "line": 62291,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@142600",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_9.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FALSTAFF.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142815",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "WESTMORELAND.\nFaith, Sir John, ’tis more than time that I were there, and you too, but my powers are there already. The King, I can tell you, looks for us all. We must away all night.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142815/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@142815/line-2",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 183,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1653940,
        "end": 1654155,
        "line": 62298,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@142815",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_9.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "WESTMORELAND.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143034",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FALSTAFF.\nTut, never fear me. I am as vigilant as a cat to steal cream.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143034/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143034/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 71,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1654159,
        "end": 1654260,
        "line": 62305,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@143034",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_9.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FALSTAFF.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143139",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PRINCE.\nI think, to steal cream indeed, for thy theft hath already made thee butter. But tell me, Jack, whose fellows are these that come after?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143139/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143139/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 144,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1654264,
        "end": 1654439,
        "line": 62310,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@143139",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_9.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PRINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143318",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FALSTAFF.\nMine, Hal, mine.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143318/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143318/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 26,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1654443,
        "end": 1654499,
        "line": 62316,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@143318",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_9.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FALSTAFF.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143378",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PRINCE.\nI did never see such pitiful rascals.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneIV_9.2/p@143378/line-1",
