      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FALSTAFF.\nWell,\nTo the latter end of a fray and the beginning of a feast\nFits a dull fighter and a keen guest.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
